# Consideration of funding proposals - Addendum V

## Funding proposal package for FP173

### Summary

This addendum contains the following seven parts:

a) A funding proposal titled "The Amazon Bioeconomy Fund: Unlocking private capital to finance climate products and services with climate mitigation and adaptation results in the Amazon";

b) No-objection letter issued by the national designated authority(ies) or local permit;

c) Environmental and social report(s) disclosure;

d) Secretary's letter;

e) Independent Technical Advisory Panel's assessment;

f) Response from the accredited entity to the independent Technical Advisory Panel's assessment; and

g) Gender documentation.

